<title>USA: TABLE -ICN PHARMACEUTICALS SELLS $275 MLN IN DEBT.</title>
<headline>TABLE -ICN PHARMACEUTICALS SELLS $275 MLN IN DEBT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a private placement of $275 million in debt from ICN Pharmaceuticals Inc was priced on Thursday via lead manager Schroder Wertheim &amp; Co, according to a market source.</p>
<p>The offering was increased from an original size of $200 million.</p>
<p>ICN, headquartered in Costa Mesa, Calif., manufactures nutrition, biomedical products and research chemicals.</p>
<p>BORROWER ICN PHARMACEUTICALS INC</p>
<p>AMT $275 MLN	 COUPON 9.25 PCT   MATURITY 8/15/05</p>
<p>TYPE SR NOTES	ISS PRICE 100     FIRST PAY DATE 2/15/98</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B1    YIELD 9.25 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB	  SPREAD +305 BPS   CALLABLE NON-CALL FOUR</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-895-1662))</p>
</text>
